{"title": "Arcane Enchantment (+2)", "pageid": 28098, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Arcane_Enchantment_(+2)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Enchantment_(%2B1)\" title=\"Arcane Enchantment (+1)\">Arcane Enchantment (+1)</a>        </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Arcane Enchantment</b> is a passive feature that boosts a caster's spellcasting ability.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain a +2 bonus to <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Save_DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Save DC\">Spell Save DC</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Attack\">Spell Attack</a> rolls. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hood_of_the_Weave\" title=\"Hood of the Weave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8b/Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8b/Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8b/Hood_of_the_Weave_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hood_of_the_Weave\" title=\"Hood of the Weave\">Hood of the Weave</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715125446\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 899/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6717/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1384/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688996/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.305      1 -total\n 97.23%   29.464      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 54.41%   16.488      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 48.46%   14.686      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 45.64%   13.832      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 24.41%    7.396      1 Template:Item_icon\n 10.61%    3.216      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  9.75%    2.955      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.51%    2.883      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  8.83%    2.676      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28098-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715125446 and revision id 244627. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}